# Next.js conventions

- Default to Server Components. Add `"use client"` only for interactivity, browser APIs, or client libraries.
- `params` and `searchParams` are Promises — always `await` them.
- Use `notFound()` for missing dynamic resources.
- Mutations → Server Actions in `features/*/actions.ts`.
- Public HTTP → `app/api/**/route.ts`.
- Keep `app/(site)/layout.tsx` for site chrome; root `app/layout.tsx` for html/body/fonts only.
- Prefer composing feature components in pages over large inline JSX in route files.
